  "description": "Single self contained granny flat on a \"rent a room\" agreement. Located in the countryside and accessed through secure electric gates, with private parking. Would only suit someone with their own transport. Household waste disposal included in the rent. Electricity is pay as you go, with €50 per month allowance included in the rent. \nIdeal for someone who is looking for their own private space in a quiet and tranquil location. They need to speak fluent English and be STRICTLY a non smoker/vaper. It would be expected that they are respectful, tidy and clean and willing to maintain the accommodation to the standard it's received in. They need to be comfortable with dogs as they are on the property. This space has its own private entrance and is accessed via stairs. Deposit and first month rent will be required prior to moving in. References will be required.\n\n**Please be advised that I may not be able to respond to all enquiries**\n\nRent displayed is for 1 pax only.\n\n15 mins drive to Kildare Village/ N7\n20 mins drive to Newbridge\n30 mins drive to Naas \n45 mins drive to Maynooth University",
